<h1>Build status</h1>

<p>This report describes the last successful site build, completed at
<time>[% report.generated_at | html %]</time> UTC for [% report.author_count %] authors.</p>
[% IF report.mode == 'cached-build' %]
<p>This build used stored snapshots. It did not contact MetaCPAN or verify current service availability.</p>
[% ELSE %]
<p>This build attempted to refresh release metadata.</p>
[% END %]

[% IF report.problems.size %]
<h2>Problems recovered during this build</h2>
<table class="table">
  <thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Author or distribution</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
[% FOR problem IN report.problems %]
    <tr><td>[% problem.service | html %]</td><td>[% problem.subject | html %]</td>
      <td>[% problem.message | html %]
      [% IF problem.gathered_at %] Last successful metadata refresh: [% problem.gathered_at | html %].[% END %]</td></tr>
[% END %]
  </tbody>
</table>
[% ELSE %]
<p>No processing problems were recorded during this build.</p>
[% END %]

<p>Builds that fail before publication cannot update this report. See the
<a href="https://github.com/PerlToolsTeam/dashboard/actions/workflows/regenerate.yml">generation workflow logs</a>
for failed runs and detailed diagnostics. External badge images are loaded by your browser;
their current availability is not checked by this report.</p>
<p><a href="data.json">Download this report as JSON</a>.</p>
